From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000008 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TB371FC Linux Project <tb371fc-linux@localhost>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:48:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: nt36523: include DSC PPS helper declaration

The TB371FC panel path packs a DSC PPS during prepare, so include the helper
API that declares drm_dsc_pps_payload_pack().
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
index 6643de2c8a61..b75fca2be54e 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include <video/mipi_display.h>
 
 #include <drm/display/drm_dsc.h>
+#include <drm/display/drm_dsc_helper.h>
 #include <drm/drm_connector.h>
 #include <drm/drm_crtc.h>
 #include <drm/drm_mipi_dsi.h>
